# Secrets and fetched data

## Never commit or paste into chat

- `.env` / `.env.local` and any real credentials
- Browser cookies, `li_at`, CSRF, `JSESSIONID`, Playwright `storage_state`
- OAuth client secrets / refresh tokens
- Full profile or connection dumps

## Local layout (preferred)

```
data/           # gitignored + cursorignored graph payloads
.env.example    # placeholder keys only — committed
.env            # real secrets — not committed
```

## When writing fetch/auth code

- Load secrets from env or a local secrets file outside the repo.
- Log request IDs / status codes, never Authorization headers or cookie values.
- If a sample fixture is needed for tests, use tiny anonymized stubs under `fixtures/` — not real exports.
